1
00:00:01,133 --> 00:00:02,866
Group executives were attacked.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,700
Estate security has been tightened.

3
00:00:05,266 --> 00:00:07,266
It's past eight. Ah Tan hasn't replied.

4
00:00:09,166 --> 00:00:11,866
Ah Tan's in the main building. Wait here.

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,633
Ah Tan, please just text me back.

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:15,800
Let me see you.

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,733
Did the general manager find out about us?

8
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,233
I only got the security alert. That's it.

9
00:00:24,066 --> 00:00:24,933
Did something really happen?

10
00:00:25,666 --> 00:00:26,666
Don't scare yourself.

11
00:00:27,366 --> 00:00:28,066
But what if?

12
00:00:29,533 --> 00:00:31,233
Didn't he say he was going to explain?

13
00:00:31,233 --> 00:00:32,400
What if things blew up?

14
00:00:32,466 --> 00:00:32,900
I have to go check.

15
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:35,500
Don't leave yet. Stay in the guest room.

16
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,566
I can't stay put until he says he's okay.

17
00:00:48,666 --> 00:00:49,033
Nawin.

18
00:00:49,666 --> 00:00:51,366
Wrong entrance. How did you get here?

19
00:00:52,533 --> 00:00:55,033
Let me see Ah Tan. I must know he's okay.

20
00:00:57,566 --> 00:00:59,200
He's in a meeting. Please wait.

21
00:00:59,666 --> 00:01:01,200
I'll take the blame for our meeting.

22
00:01:01,633 --> 00:01:02,866
I'll talk to the general manager myself.

23
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,600
I'm the one who went after him.

24
00:01:04,666 --> 00:01:06,000
Take it out on me. Don't be hard on him.

25
00:01:08,966 --> 00:01:09,333
Nawin.

26
00:01:10,266 --> 00:01:11,100
How did you find your way here?

27
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:14,500
General Manager, should we pause?

28
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,400
General... Manager?

29
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:21,866
Pause the meeting. Nawin, I'm Thanat.
